    old "Sarah had completed another round of meetings. The fourth one today."
    new "Sarah tinha terminado mais uma série de reuniões. A quarta do dia."

    old "Each day passed the same, and even though she did as much as she could, it still felt like too little."
    new "Cada dia passava da mesma forma e, embora ela fizesse o máximo que podia, ainda parecia ser muito pouco."

    old "Marion's uprising had not appeared to lose steam as they had hoped."
    new "A rebelião de Marion não parecia ter perdido força como eles esperavam."

    old "Rather, while his forces were starved by the river blockade, they had now taken to raiding the border provinces, setting fire to farms and seizing their crops and livestock."
    new "Em vez disso, enquanto suas forças eram privadas de suprimentos pelo bloqueio do rio, agora passaram a atacar as províncias fronteiriças, incendiando fazendas e tomando suas colheitas e gado."

    old "The displaced farmers fled, arriving homeless and peniless in other towns, causing more disruption in those towns."
    new "Os agricultores deslocados fugiram, chegando desabrigados e sem um tostão em outras cidades, causando ainda mais perturbação nesses locais."

    old "The forces were too small to counter, sneaking across the river at night. It seemed like they were everywhere and nowhere at the same time."
    new "As forças eram pequenas demais para serem combatidas, atravessando o rio furtivamente durante a noite. Parecia que estavam em todos os lugares e, ao mesmo tempo, em nenhum."

    old "Sarah racked her mind trying to find a solution, but found herself running in circles and circles."
    new "Sarah vasculhou sua mente tentando encontrar uma solução, mas acabou se sentindo como se estivesse correndo em círculos sem fim."

    old "As much as she wanted to solve everything by herself, she knew she needed advice."
    new "Por mais que quisesse resolver tudo sozinha, ela sabia que precisava de conselhos."

    old "Usually, she would have spoken with Thomas, but he was gone now."
    new "Normalmente, ela teria conversado com Thomas, mas ele estava ausente agora."

    old "Varga had been another option, but she had avoided him since sending him away from her room."
    new "Varga teria sido outra opção, mas ela o evitava desde que o mandou sair de seu quarto."

    old "Ironically, she thought, she might have once considered asking Marion for advice."
    new "Ironicamente, ela pensou, talvez já tivesse considerado pedir conselhos a Marion no passado."

    old "She was quickly running out of allies. So who was left, she wondered."
    new "Ela estava rapidamente ficando sem aliados. Então, quem restava, ela se perguntava."

    old "Ask Carolyn for advice"
    new "Perguntar a Carolyn sobre conselhos"

    old "Sarah knew who she had to ask, Lady Carolyn."
    new "Sarah sabia a quem precisava pedir conselhos: Lady Carolyn."

    old "Lady Carolyn was a woman in a man's world, much like herself, so who better than her to help her find her way?"
    new "Lady Carolyn era uma mulher num mundo de homens, assim como ela mesma, então quem melhor do que ela para ajudá-la a encontrar seu caminho?"

    old "Sarah had always quietly respected her and the way in which she carried herself."
