    old "She quickly stepped out of the room, closing the door behind her."
    new "Ela saiu rapidamente do quarto, fechando a porta atrás de si."

    old "Sarah runs as fast as she can down the hallways of the castle."
    new "Sarah corre o mais rápido que pode pelos corredores do castelo."

    old "Talk to Lily"
    new "Falar com Lily"

    old "Sarah know who she had to talk to, Lily Highfield."
    new "Sarah sabia com quem precisava falar: Lily Highfield."

    old "The girl had only recently entered her service, but had already worked hard to prove herself."
    new "A garota havia acabado de começar seu serviço, mas já havia trabalhado duro para se provar."

    old "She was the same age as Sarah, and after spending a day talking to rooms full of old men, she needed to speak to someone that she could relate to."
    new "Ela tinha a mesma idade de Sarah e, depois de passar o dia conversando com salas cheias de homens mais velhos, precisava falar com alguém com quem pudesse se identificar."

    old "Sarah searched the castle grounds for a while, even ordering some servants to help her in finding the distant heir of the Highfield family."
    new "Sarah procurou pelos terrenos do castelo por um tempo, chegando a ordenar que alguns servos a ajudassem a encontrar a distante herdeira da família Highfield."

    old "Finally, a servant came to inform her that the girl could be found at the training grounds, just outside of Castle Reinmeer."
    new "Finalmente, um servo veio informá-la de que a jovem poderia ser encontrada nos campos de treinamento, logo do lado de fora do Castelo Reinmeer."

    old "The training grounds were a small plot of land, just beyond the walls of the city, most used by the army for basic formation excercises."
    new "Os campos de treinamento eram uma pequena área de terra, logo além das muralhas da cidade, usada principalmente pelo exército para exercícios básicos de formação."

    old "Initially, Sarah could not find the girl, expecting her to be close to the other soldiers."
    new "Inicialmente, Sarah não conseguia encontrar a garota, esperando que ela estivesse perto dos outros soldados."

    old "Instead, she found Lily a small ways away from the others, training all by herself."
    new "Em vez disso, ela encontrou Lily um pouco afastada dos outros, treinando completamente sozinha."

    old "For a moment, she observed Lily, not yet aware that she was being observed."
    new "Por um momento, ela observou Lily, sem ainda perceber que também estava sendo observada."

    old "She swung her blade vertically, her body followed the movement of the blade, spinning her body as though she were a dancer, finishing by thrusting her blade forward."
    new "Ela brandiu a lâmina verticalmente; seu corpo seguiu o movimento da lâmina, girando como se fosse uma dançarina, e finalizou com uma estocada para a frente."

    old "Watching the girl, Sarah noticed there was something different about her bladework."
    new "Observando a garota, Sarah notou que havia algo diferente na sua técnica com a lâmina."

    old "Sarah was the first to admit that she herself was no great warrior, but she'd observed enough training excercises where her brother Thomas was smacked around by the quartermaster."
    new "Sarah foi a primeira a admitir que ela mesma não era uma grande guerreira, mas já havia observado exercícios de treinamento suficientes em que seu irmão Thomas era espancado pelo intendente."

    old "Lily clearly fought different. There was a strength, but strangely, also a graceful flowing movement, more akin to her own dance lessons."
    new "Lily lutava de forma claramente diferente. Havia uma força, mas, estranhamente, também um movimento fluido e gracioso, mais parecido com as suas próprias aulas de dança."

    old "Sarah cleared her throat."
    new "Sarah limpou a garganta."

    old "Startled, Lily turned around."
    new "Assustada, Lily virou-se."

    old "I...my lady!"
    new "Eu... minha senhora!"

    old "Lily fell to her knee, driving her sword into the ground before her."
    new "Lily caiu de joelhos, cravando sua espada no chão à sua frente."

    old "Sarah waved her hand, dismissing the girl's gesture."
    new "Sarah acenou com a mão, dispensando o gesto da garota."

    old "Please, Lily. No need for the formalities."
    new "Por favor, Lily. Não há necessidade de formalidades."

    old "But...my grace...I vowed to serve you."
    new "Mas... minha graça... eu jurei servi-la."

    old "Yes, Lily and you will, as my personal guard. You can't exactly serve me as my personal guard when you're constantly falling onto a knee when you should be looking out for enemies, right?"
